  nonce: 5d5d  # 5d5d
  message: "Fixed via merged PR (dev 455a1a187a). Text & JSON now report the SAME canonical headline count. Behavioral before→after: on the self-corpus the JSON total_io_edges was 8428 (incl 8134 external_potential = 96.5% receiver-unresolved builtin noise) while text post-suppression showed only real categories — a ~9-28x disagreement with no reconciling disclosure. Now total_io_edges = real/verified categories only (294 on self-corpus) in BOTH modes regardless of --show-external-potential; external_potential disclosed separately as external_potential_edges (JSON) and as a '+N external_potential [unverified, excluded from total]' headline note + suppression line (text). IO_BOUNDARIES_SCHEMA_VERSION 1.0->2.0. Production-path: cmd_io_boundaries JSON + text headline; envelope property tests updated (TestIoBoundariesEnvelopeSchema, test_cmd_io_boundaries_json_envelope_top_level_keys). awaits_bakeoff_validation: the headline number moves ~28x."  # 5d5d
